NOTE ON REUSED COMPONENTS

This license covers only the original content of the pocket-agc repository
(documentation, and future original code). It does NOT cover third-party
components the project reuses:

  - The original Apollo flight software (e.g. Comanche055, Luminary099) is
    US government work in the public domain.

  - Virtual AGC components (e.g. yaAGC, yaDSKY2) are distributed under the
    GNU General Public License by their authors.

Once this project distributes a build that includes or links such components,
the combined work will likely need to adopt a GPL-compatible license. See
docs/04-prior-art.md for the tracked licensing decision.
